        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU BETTER BEHAVE OR BA BỊ WILL GET YOU!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, first things first, congrats on being a terrible kid. Because now <strong>Ba Bị</strong> has you. Yeah. That Ba Bị. The one your parents used to whisper about when you refused to sleep. Turns out he’s real. And in this game, you’re one of four “naughty” kids he’s dragged off into the dark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/db6fdb109244c1a8854e27537405b358.poster.avif?t=1771852303\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/db6fdb109244c1a8854e27537405b358.webm?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/db6fdb109244c1a8854e27537405b358.mp4?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hey, good news: he’s not asking for your soul. He just wants proof you’re a good child. And with him, “good” doesn’t mean brave or kind. It means <strong>good grades. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So welcome to the nightmare good kid challenge. To survive, you’ll have to pass <strong>9 parts of Ba Bị’s “test”</strong>, a series of minigames disguised as familiar school subjects like <strong>Biology</strong>, <strong>Math</strong>, and <strong>History</strong>… plus childhood classics you thought were harmless:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/df15217e53e51eb4e61a4dee79123015.poster.avif?t=1771852303\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/df15217e53e51eb4e61a4dee79123015.webm?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/df15217e53e51eb4e61a4dee79123015.mp4?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Minesweeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rock–Paper–Scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hangman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">…and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>TICK..TOCK...TICK...TOCK, YOU HAVE 15 MINS TO PASS THE TEST!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make too many mistakes or let the timer run out. <strong>YOU WILL BE PUNISHED.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal isn’t to escape.It’s to become the <i>good child</i> everyone expects. Because only kids with a perfect-enough score get to go home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own avatar </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the shoes of a child being judged and this time, you don’t get to look away. You can customize the look of the kid. Simply by drag and drop the image file to the game's window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/d7f783f085ad38c3b9599eecc352d401.poster.avif?t=1771852303\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/d7f783f085ad38c3b9599eecc352d401.webm?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/d7f783f085ad38c3b9599eecc352d401.mp4?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the fear you grew up with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because this time, Ba Bị isn’t coming for <i>some</i> kid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He’s coming for <strong>you</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU BETTER BEHAVE OR BA BỊ WILL GET YOU!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, first things first, congrats on being a terrible kid. Because now <strong>Ba Bị</strong> has you. Yeah. That Ba Bị. The one your parents used to whisper about when you refused to sleep. Turns out he’s real. And in this game, you’re one of four “naughty” kids he’s dragged off into the dark. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/db6fdb109244c1a8854e27537405b358.poster.avif?t=1771852303\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/db6fdb109244c1a8854e27537405b358.webm?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/db6fdb109244c1a8854e27537405b358.mp4?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hey, good news: he’s not asking for your soul. He just wants proof you’re a good child. And with him, “good” doesn’t mean brave or kind. It means <strong>good grades. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So welcome to the nightmare good kid challenge. To survive, you’ll have to pass <strong>9 parts of Ba Bị’s “test”</strong>, a series of minigames disguised as familiar school subjects like <strong>Biology</strong>, <strong>Math</strong>, and <strong>History</strong>… plus childhood classics you thought were harmless:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/df15217e53e51eb4e61a4dee79123015.poster.avif?t=1771852303\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/df15217e53e51eb4e61a4dee79123015.webm?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/df15217e53e51eb4e61a4dee79123015.mp4?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Minesweeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rock–Paper–Scissors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hangman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">…and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>TICK..TOCK...TICK...TOCK, YOU HAVE 15 MINS TO PASS THE TEST!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make too many mistakes or let the timer run out. <strong>YOU WILL BE PUNISHED.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal isn’t to escape.It’s to become the <i>good child</i> everyone expects. Because only kids with a perfect-enough score get to go home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own avatar </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the shoes of a child being judged and this time, you don’t get to look away. You can customize the look of the kid. Simply by drag and drop the image file to the game's window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/d7f783f085ad38c3b9599eecc352d401.poster.avif?t=1771852303\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/d7f783f085ad38c3b9599eecc352d401.webm?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4201500/extras/d7f783f085ad38c3b9599eecc352d401.mp4?t=1771852303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the fear you grew up with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because this time, Ba Bị isn’t coming for <i>some</i> kid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He’s coming for <strong>you</strong>.</p>",
        "short_description": "Ba Bị is the Boogeyman of Vietnamese folklore, the shadow that takes bad children away. You are one of four kids he has captured. Pass his twisted test in 15 mins to prove you’re a good child or pay the price. But the deeper you go, you realize this test was never really about grades.",
